{"id":"n72772-1-8","stage":5,"title":"일삼다 · 成性","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72772-1-8-1","ko":"도둑질을 일삼던 남자가 경찰에 붙잡혔대.","zh":"据说那个经常偷东西的男子被警察抓到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도둑질을","meaning":"偷窃，盗窃","explanation":"도둑질：偷窃，盗窃；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"도둑질","audio":"/audio/606152bf2495439a5baf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47819","senseId":"1","lemma":"도둑질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도둑질을","audio":"/audio/1492584643dc10867a74.mp3"}},{"text":"일삼던","meaning":"成性，专干","explanation":"일삼다：成性，专干；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"일삼다","audio":"/audio/deb05d03746281508830.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72772","senseId":"1","lemma":"일삼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일삼던","audio":"/audio/8b4290265fdceb0f2c77.mp3"}},{"text":"남자가","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자가","audio":"/audio/2febf4b5eefa29bbf8ef.mp3"}},{"text":"경찰에","meaning":"警方，警察当局","explanation":"경찰：警方，警察当局；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"경찰","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25949","senseId":"1","lemma":"경찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경찰에","audio":"/audio/33c2ff329cc318efacb2.mp3"}},{"text":"붙잡혔대.","meaning":"(人、动物等)被抓住","explanation":"붙잡히다：(人、动物等)被抓住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"붙잡히다","audio":"/audio/8bdcf9dae64d4cee78e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25658","senseId":"2","lemma":"붙잡히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙잡혔대","audio":"/audio/7ffb6b61dc3fd6b6c8d4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"606152bf2495439a","term":"도둑질","zh":"偷窃，盗窃","audio":"/audio/606152bf2495439a5baf.mp3","entryId":"47819","definition":"暗地里偷盗或随意拿走别人的东西。","pronunciation":["도둑찔"]},{"id":"deb05d0374628150","term":"일삼다","zh":"成性，专干","audio":"/audio/deb05d03746281508830.mp3","entryId":"72772","definition":"不断地做不好的事情。","pronunciation":["일ː삼따"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"642315305ad78197","term":"경찰","zh":"警方，警察当局","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3","entryId":"25949","definition":"维持社会秩序、保护人民生命和财产安全；或指负责此事的国家机关。","pronunciation":["경ː찰"]},{"id":"8bdcf9dae64d4cee","term":"붙잡히다","zh":"(人、动物等)被抓住","audio":"/audio/8bdcf9dae64d4cee78e9.mp3","entryId":"25658","definition":"逃跑的对象被捉住。","pronunciation":["붇짜피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c761c1b121de501f46df.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72772-1-8-2","ko":"나쁜 짓을 했으니 벌을 받아야지.","zh":"做了坏事就该受到惩罚。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나쁜","meaning":"不道德，不良，恶劣","explanation":"나쁘다：不道德，不良，恶劣；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"3","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나쁜","audio":"/audio/e203b60c1df7f7cc3ba8.mp3"}},{"text":"짓을","meaning":"勾当","explanation":"짓：勾当；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"짓","audio":"/audio/e8d6da57e6e7c8a524ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62487","senseId":"1","lemma":"짓","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짓을","audio":"/audio/91dc783cb08a384b7415.mp3"}},{"text":"했으니","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했으니","audio":"/audio/7413e77c37316c797660.mp3"}},{"text":"벌을","meaning":"惩罚，罚","explanation":"벌：惩罚，罚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"벌",